{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_steel_plate","model_identifier":"armour_steel_plate","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_steel_plate\n\nArmour set, steel plate.\n\n- Cubes: 18 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -12.5..12.5, y -0.5..52.0, z -6.0..6.0 (size 25.0 x 52.5 x 12.0 u = 70 x 148 x 34 cm).\nSteel plate harness: breastplate with a raised centre ridge (on `torso`, inflate 1.0), banded fauld on `hips` (1.0), pauldrons on `arm_upper_r/l` (inflate 1.5, layered over the breastplate), rerebraces (1.0), vambraces on `arm_lower` (1.0), gauntlets on `hand` (0.5, cuff of the fist only so the grip stays clear), cuisses on `leg_upper` (1.0, leaving the hip and knee joints open), greaves with a ridge on `leg_lower` (1.0) and laminated sabatons on `foot` (0.5). Bright steel plates with dark edges. Steel and high-quality steel textures. Same bones/pivots as warrior_base. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `armour_steel_plate_steel.png`, `armour_steel_plate_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## armour_steel_plate\n\nArmour set, steel plate.\n\n- Cubes: 18 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -12.5..12.5, y -0.5..52.0, z -6.0..6.0 (size 25.0 x 52.5 x 12.0 u = 70 x 148 x 34 cm).\nSteel plate harness: breastplate with a raised centre ridge (on `torso`, inflate 1.0), banded fauld on `hips` (1.0), pauldrons on `arm_upper_r/l` (inflate 1.5, layered over the breastplate), rerebraces (1.0), vambraces on `arm_lower` (1.0), gauntlets on `hand` (0.5, cuff of the fist only so the grip stays clear), cuisses on `leg_upper` (1.0, leaving the hip and knee joints open), greaves with a ridge on `leg_lower` (1.0) and laminated sabatons on `foot` (0.5). Bright steel plates with dark edges. Steel and high-quality steel textures. Same bones/pivots as warrior_base. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `armour_steel_plate_steel.png`, `armour_steel_plate_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"breastplate","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,36.0,-4.0],"to":[7.0,50.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,"origin":[0.0,33.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,14.0,14.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,0,36.0,14.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,0,28.0,14.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[36,0,44.0,14.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,34,14.0,42.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[14,34,28.0,42.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4695e345-22ff-5249-bae8-3d00626bb12d"},{"name":"ridge","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,38.0,-5.5],"to":[0.5,49.0,-5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,33.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20,14,21.0,25.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[21,14,21.5,25.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,14,23.0,25.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[23,14,23.5,25.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[50,67,51.0,67.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[51,67,52.0,67.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"84bd1dac-4383-578d-bad4-4859057ca09d"},{"name":"fauld","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,26.0,-3.5],"to":[6.0,33.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,"origin":[0.0,28.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[48,34,60.0,41.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36,42,43.0,49.0],"texture